cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or the model it trains, please cite it as below."
title: "Bengali FastConformer-CTC: corpus construction, admission audits, training and evaluation"
abstract: >-
  Training and evaluation code for ehzawad/stt_bn_fastconformer_ctc, a
  FastConformer-CTC large for Bengali trained on 1,692 hours of human-supervised
  speech: corpus construction with measured admission gates, a warm-start
  trainer with regression guards and eligibility-based checkpoint selection,
  panel evaluation on a frozen scoring surface, and a sealed one-decode test
  procedure with paired bootstraps.
authors:
